{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00771",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 0.56,
      "end_seconds": 14.27,
      "duration_seconds": 13.71,
      "text": "Doctor, my wife burnt her arm with hot oil, in the kitchen. I put it under the tap straight away, for I don't know how long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.99,
      "end_seconds": 19.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "It hurts so much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.4,
      "end_seconds": 27.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Mrs Gupta, I'm Dr Mehra. Let me see. How long ago did this happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.12,
      "end_seconds": 36.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "About an hour. Maybe more. I don't remember, I was so shocked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 37.25,
      "end_seconds": 46.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "It was less than an hour, I'm sure, because I looked at the clock when I phoned the ambulance."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.35,
      "end_seconds": 58.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "Let's say within the last hour or so, it doesn't matter for treatment. What were you doing? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.39,
      "end_seconds": 67.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Frying pooris. The oil spat and splashed up my left forearm. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.17,
      "end_seconds": 72.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "How long was it under cold water? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 74.15,
      "end_seconds": 78.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I think ten minutes. Maybe fifteen. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.62,
      "end_seconds": 88.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "That's good, that's the right thing to do. Are you diabetic, or do you have any other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.26,
      "end_seconds": 95.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "I have diabetes and high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.14,
      "end_seconds": 101.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "And what do you do for a living?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.14,
      "end_seconds": 110.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "I'm a school teacher. I use my arms all day, writing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.65,
      "end_seconds": 133.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Let me look at the arm. I'm going to be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.18,
      "end_seconds": 137.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Ow, that's very painful. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.68,
      "end_seconds": 159.05,
      "duration_seconds": 20.37,
      "text": "I know, we'll sort the pain in a moment. There's a red area about ten centimetres by six on the inner forearm, with a few blisters, and it's very tender. The skin around is intact."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 160.93,
      "end_seconds": 163.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Is it bad? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.28,
      "end_seconds": 174.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.29,
      "text": "It's a partial thickness burn, so the top layers of skin are damaged, but it isn't the deepest kind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.53,
      "end_seconds": 178.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Will it scar? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.08,
      "end_seconds": 190.76,
      "duration_seconds": 11.68,
      "text": "Burns like this usually heal in two to three weeks, often without a scar, if we keep them clean and don't burst the blisters. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.43,
      "end_seconds": 195.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Oh good. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.68,
      "end_seconds": 212.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Pulse 92, blood pressure 138 over 84, temperature 36.8, oxygen 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 215.76,
      "end_seconds": 218.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "She's shaking, doctor. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.18,
      "end_seconds": 235.38,
      "duration_seconds": 15.2,
      "text": "That's the shock and pain. The nurse will give her something for the pain now, and I'll dress the burn with a non-stick dressing. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.66,
      "end_seconds": 239.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Thank you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.99,
      "end_seconds": 248.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "I'd like to check your blood sugar now, because with diabetes, infection is a bigger risk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.68,
      "end_seconds": 254.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "It was normal this morning. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.7,
      "end_seconds": 266.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "Good. I'd also like to arrange a dressing review in two days, with the nurse, to check for signs of infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 267.28,
      "end_seconds": 269.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.87,
      "end_seconds": 279.24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "Keep the arm raised on a pillow, don't pop the blisters, and keep the dressing dry."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.69,
      "end_seconds": 283.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Can I teach tomorrow? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.38,
      "end_seconds": 291.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "With the arm covered, probably, but take it easy. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 293.59,
      "end_seconds": 296.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I'll drive her. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.02,
      "end_seconds": 307.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.48,
      "text": "If the dressing becomes soaked, the redness spreads, you get a fever, or a bad smell, come back immediately."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.78,
      "end_seconds": 311.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I will. Thank you. ~"
    }
  ]
}
